{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22278","headline":"郡中即事 · 白居易","name":"郡中即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漫漫潮初平，熙熙春日至。\n空阔远江山，晴明好天气。\n外有适意物，中无系心事。\n数篇对竹吟，一杯望云醉。\n行携杖扶力，卧读书取睡。\n久养病形骸，深谙闲气味。\n遥思九城陌，扰扰趋名利。\n今朝是双日，朝谒多轩骑。\n宠者防悔尤，权者怀忧畏。\n爲报高车盖，恐非真富贵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}